417] [17592186340325 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340325 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8570d30f-c584-59aa-b761-2fc860940003" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340680 #edb/ref 1080 "The entire $xy$-plane" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340680 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340680 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "aa1cdee6-ac73-548c-adcc-2f2217142d90" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186339492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186339630 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340133 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340325 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186340680 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186339630 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186341494 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "3fd0265d-f2bf-5b7a-b5a0-01ae09a136be" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342131 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186341494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342131 #edb/ref 1069 "q-74015" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342131 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342131 #edb/ref 1071 "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet $\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{4}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342131 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c94f24ee-6291-5f63-846b-0a8b39098945" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342131 #edb/ref 1074 "From the hyperboloid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{4} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}-1 & =\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(z-1)^{2} & =4(\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}-1) \\\\ z-1 & =\\pm 2\\sqrt{\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}-1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ \\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2} & \\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the exterior of the ellipse $\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}=1,$ which includes the boundary.\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{7}+\\frac{(y+8)^{2}}{2}\\ge 1}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378934 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186378935 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378934 #edb/ref 1069 "q-164376" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378934 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378934 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the trace in the $xy$-plane of the hyperboloid of two sheets $-{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16}=-1?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378934 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "4b4af7bd-0bee-5303-8db2-07166632d8d1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378934 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the trace in the $xy$-plane, we substitute $z=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid. This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{16} & =-1 \\\\ -{x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & =-1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-{y}^{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is the equation of a hyperbola in $xy$-plane." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378935 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378936 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378935 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378937 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378935 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378938 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378935 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378939 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378935 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186378940 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378935 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186378935 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [175921